  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "He reads words but struggles explaining the story.",
  "dialogue_zh": "他能够读出单词，但不太会讲解故事内容。",
  "start_time": 15.18,
  "end_time": 17.82,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_009"
 },
 {
  "id": 1555,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 10,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "He sometimes loses focus during independent work.",
  "dialogue_zh": "他有时在独立完成任务时会注意力不集中。",
  "start_time": 18.99,
  "end_time": 21.2,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_010"
 },
 {
  "id": 1556,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 11,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Parent",
  "speaker_zh": "家长",
  "dialogue_en": "Does that happen often?",
  "dialogue_zh": "这种情况经常发生吗？",
  "start_time": 21.74,
  "end_time": 22.5,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_011"
 },
 {
  "id": 1557,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 12,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "He needs reminders to stay on task, especially with reading or writing.",
  "dialogue_zh": "他需要别人提醒才能专注于当前任务，尤其是在阅读或写作时。",
  "start_time": 22.91,
  "end_time": 26.2,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_012"
 },
 {
  "id": 1558,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 13,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Parent",
  "speaker_zh": "家长",
  "dialogue_en": "We see that at home too.",
  "dialogue_zh": "我们在家里也注意到了。",
  "start_time": 26.7,
  "end_time": 27.8,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_013"
 },
 {
  "id": 1559,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 14,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Parent",
  "speaker_zh": "家长",
  "dialogue_en": "Do you think he’s falling behind?",
  "dialogue_zh": "你觉得他落后了吗？",
  "start_time": 28.33,
  "end_time": 29.62,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_014"
 },
 {
  "id": 1560,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 15,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "No, but he needs extra practice.",
  "dialogue_zh": "没有，不过他需要多加练习。",
  "start_time": 30.1,
  "end_time": 31.47,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_015"
 },
 {
  "id": 1561,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 16,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Parent",
  "speaker_zh": "家长",
  "dialogue_en": "Is he participating in class?",
  "dialogue_zh": "他在课堂上积极参与吗？",
  "start_time": 32.22,
  "end_time": 33.68,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_016"
 },
 {
  "id": 1562,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 17,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "He participates when he feels confident.",
  "dialogue_zh": "有信心的时候他会参与。",
  "start_time": 33.92,
  "end_time": 35.4,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_017"
 },
 {
  "id": 1563,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 18,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "But sometimes he hesitates in front of the class.",
  "dialogue_zh": "不过在全班同学面前，他有时会有些犹豫。",
  "start_time": 35.76,
  "end_time": 37.9,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_018"
 },
 {
  "id": 1564,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 19,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Parent",
  "speaker_zh": "家长",
  "dialogue_en": "What can we do at home?",
  "dialogue_zh": "我们在家可以做些什么？",
  "start_time": 38.34,
  "end_time": 39.3,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_019"
 },
 {
  "id": 1565,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 20,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "Try reading together every day.",
  "dialogue_zh": "试着每天和他一起阅读。",
  "start_time": 39.77,
  "end_time": 41.25,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_020"
 },
 {
  "id": 1566,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 21,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "Ask him what happened in the story or why a character did that.",
  "dialogue_zh": "可以问问他故事里发生了什么，或者某个人物为什么会那样做。",
  "start_time": 41.69,
  "end_time": 44.8,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_021"
 },
 {
  "id": 1567,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 22,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Parent",
  "speaker_zh": "家长",
  "dialogue_en": "Should we work on writing?",
  "dialogue_zh": "我们需要练习写作吗？",
  "start_time": 45.32,
  "end_time": 46.1,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_022"
 },
 {
  "id": 1568,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 23,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "Yes. Even a few sentences help.",
  "dialogue_zh": "即使只写几个句子也会有帮助。",
  "start_time": 46.4,
  "end_time": 47.86,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_023"
 },
 {
  "id": 1569,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 24,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Parent",
  "speaker_zh": "家长",
  "dialogue_en": "How can we keep track of his progress?",
  "dialogue_zh": "我们怎样才能持续了解他的进步情况？",
  "start_time": 48.15,
  "end_time": 49.6,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_024"
 },
 {
  "id": 1570,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 25,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "I’ll continue to monitor him in class.",
  "dialogue_zh": "我会继续观察他在课堂上的表现。",
  "start_time": 49.96,
  "end_time": 51.4,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_025"
 },
 {
  "id": 1571,
  "scene_id": 42,
  "line_order": 26,
  "step": null,
  "speaker": "Teacher",
  "speaker_zh": "老师",
  "dialogue_en": "Let’s give it a few weeks",
  "dialogue_zh": "我们先观察几周",
  "start_time": 52,
  "end_time": 53.4,
  "created_at": "2026-08-12T22:17:56.886809+00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T22:48:18.509006+00:00",
  "external_line_id": "scene_027_line_026"
 },
 {
